<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Greater Latrobe School Auth, Pa..</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Greater Latrobe School Auth, Pa..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheetz Smith Division of Mellon Financial Markets, Inc said it priced $10 million of Greater Latrobe School Authority, Pa., school building revenue bonds, series of 1997, with a top yield of 4.65 percent in 2005.</p>
<p>The final pricing follows:</p>
<p> AMT: 10,000,000     DATE: 02/20/97	     </p>
<p>ISSUER: Greater Latrobe School Authority			  ST: PA		 </p>
<p>ISSUE: School Building Revenue Bonds, Series of 1997	  TAX STAT: Exempt   </p>
<p>M/SP/F: A3/NA/NA							  BOOK ENTRY: N	</p>
<p>ENHANCEMENTS: FSA Aaa/NR/NA					   BANK QUAL: Y	 </p>
<p>DTD: 03/15/97							     SURE BID: N	  </p>
<p>DUE: 4/1/99-05					     1ST CPN: 10/01/97		 </p>
<p>CALL: 4/1/02 @ par					 </p>
<p>DELIVERY: 3/17/97 firm				    </p>
<p>Year		     Amount    Coupon     Yield    </p>
<p>1999		    265,000     4.000     4.000    </p>
<p>2000		    435,000     4.100     4.100    </p>
<p>2001		    950,000     4.250     4.250    </p>
<p>2002		  2,600,000     4.350     4.350    </p>
<p>2003		  2,710,000     4.350     4.450    </p>
<p>2004		  2,825,000     4.450     4.550    </p>
<p>2005		    215,000     4.550     4.650    </p>
<p>Scheetz Smith Division of Mellon Financial Markets, Inc.</p>
